 "rationale": [
  "Exploratory multi-turn setting (dev only). SCBench sessions share one context across 5 queries; the contexts are 300K+ characters, so the context is middle-truncated to 24K Qwen3 tokens to fit the 32K window with 5 turns of at most 512 new tokens each. Some queries may refer to truncated text; the setting measures cache behaviour, not answer quality.",
  "The KV cache, page bounds and page ids persist across turns (collect.long.capture_session); the trace concatenates the decode steps of all turns (turn_of_step), and the replay keeps the cache between turns. Prefill of each new turn is dense.",
